<div>
Happy Holidays from the Flywire Healthcare Team! 
<br />
<br />Welcome to the launch of our official client newsletter! We begin this adventure with a look back at 2021. Despite an incredibly historic moment for our company with the successful launch of our IPO in early 2021, as well as our first-ever virtual industry event, 
<a href="https://flywire.foleon.com/events/flywire-forward/cover/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=" target="_blank">Flywire Forward</a>, our attention continued to remain on delivering the best billing and payment performance for our clients and financial experience for your patients. You can find some highlights and exciting moments from our year below.
<br />
<br />Thank you for continuing to be on this exciting journey with us. We wish a safe and Happy New Year to you and your family. We’ll see you in 2022!
<br />
<br />-John Talaga, EVP &amp; GM, Healthcare, Flywire
</div> 
<div>
<br />
</div> 
